with the symbols.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-linear world to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets and bonus areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No annoying tutorials. You discover the Rules as you go.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorblind-friendly visuals.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085710/extras/Bridges.gif?t=1747229484\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A soothing, dark music and sound effects by Grzegorz Bednorz reflect the mechanics as they are used.<br><br>A demo will be available on Steam late May. In the meantime, join our Discord (link on the right) and become a playtester!</p>","developers":["Andrew Jones"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085710/2f172224981b6589f3e55dd31b226997320826de/header.jpg?t=1747229484","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257039218,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039218/movie480.mp4?t=1726577975","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039218/movie_max.mp4?t=1726577975"},"name":"Announcment Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257039218/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726577975","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039218/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1726577975","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257039218/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1726577975"}}],"name":"Trifoil","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":